  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag144" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font&gt;In 2026, the Company collected amounts from shippers related to the vacated Rehearing Order, 178 FERC 61,023. As a result, the adjustment is considered distortive to current year operating revenue and has been recorded to Account 645, Unusual or Infrequent Items (Credit) in the amount of $1,519,606.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
