  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:label="value4" xlink:href="#Tag36" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:label="value5" xlink:href="#Tag152" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:label="value6" xlink:href="#Tag177" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:label="value7" xlink:href="#Tag178" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p style="language: en-US; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-indent: 0in; mso-vertical-align-alt: auto; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: +mn-ea; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; language: en-US; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; vertical-align: baseline; mso-text-raise: 0%; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;">Red River</xhtml:span>
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: +mn-ea; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; language: en-US; vertical-align: baseline; mso-text-raise: 0%; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;"> Pipeline Company LLC has adopted the Association of Oil Pipelines Accounting Guideline 3-13, "Equity Reporting for Non-corporate Filers" (the "guideline").  The guideline suggests that any distributions in excess of the positive balance in unappropriated retained income should be recorded against additional paid-in capital.  Current year distributions were $24,177,000 which exceeded unappropriated retained income by $6,299,200 as of June 30, 2026.  Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital. </xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value4" xlink:to="footnote4" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="4" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote5" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p style="language: en-US; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-indent: 0in; mso-vertical-align-alt: auto; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: +mn-ea; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; language: en-US; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; vertical-align: baseline; mso-text-raise: 0%; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;">Red River</xhtml:span>
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: +mn-ea; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; language: en-US; vertical-align: baseline; mso-text-raise: 0%; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;"> Pipeline Company LLC has adopted the Association of Oil Pipelines Accounting Guideline 3-13, "Equity Reporting for Non-corporate Filers" (the "guideline").  The guideline suggests that any distributions in excess of the positive balance in unappropriated retained income should be recorded against additional paid-in capital.  Current year distributions were $24,177,000 which exceeded unappropriated retained income by $6,299,200 as of June 30, 2026.  Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital. </xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value5" xlink:to="footnote5" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote6" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>In 2026, the Company collected amounts from shippers related to the vacated Rehearing Order, 178 FERC 61,023 in the amount of $1,519,606.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
